<title>POLAND: SWARZEDZ OCT NET FLAT AT PLN 0.2 MLN.</title>
<headline>SWARZEDZ OCT NET FLAT AT PLN 0.2 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results October</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.16 vs   0.18</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.16 vs   0.33</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.03 vs   1.60</p>
<p> Sales		   10.79 vs   9.72</p>
<p>JANUARY-OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net loss		33.91 vs   1.06 profit</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	33.80 vs   2.62</p>
<p> Operating loss	22.61 vs  10.83 profit</p>
<p> Sales		   86.49 vs  81.75</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish furniture maker is Swarzedzkie</p>
<p>Fabryki Mebli Swarzedz SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
